      "statut": "numerique",
      "texte": {
        "aValiderParLeLabel": false,
        "corps": "Introducing our very first VA : a compilation of 8 tracks by artists we love and who orbit around the label. Alongside our vinyl releases, this digital series, designed as an annual rendezvous, gives us the chance to invite our friends to share a track, just for the love of sound.\n\nHouse, Minimal, Deep, Funk or Downtempo: 8 sun-soaked tracks to set the tone for your summer, your beach days, your befores, your parties, your afters.",
