      "statut": "epuise",
      "texte": {
        "aValiderParLeLabel": false,
        "corps": "Emi Ömar kicks off the year on our imprint series with a powerful and evocative EP, designed as a sonic journey through his live performances of 2024.\n\nLeading figure in electro-funk, Emi Ömar delves into uncharted music territories. Known for his sharp prestations, his blend of vocoder, bleepy/funky sounds, and deep/fat grooves captures the raw energy of live electronic music.\n\nThe tracks weave a musical narrative that reflects the vision and technical mastery of a passionate artist. An experience that will resonate with both electronic music enthusiasts and explorers of new soundscapes.",
        "langue": "en"
      },
      "titre": "Homo Musicus EP"
